.SH NAME
layered \- Stacks an optional overlay layer over content
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
layered(content: impl Into<Element<'a, M, Theme>>, layer: Option<Element<'a, M, Theme>>)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Stacks an optional overlay layer over \fBcontent\fR. The stack is \fBalways\fR present, so showing or hiding the layer never changes the content's place in the widget tree: its state (scroll offsets, focus, animations) survives, and it does not move. Without a layer the second slot is an empty placeholder.
